       "text": "<em>antiguo </em>is Spanish for \"ancient\" or \"old;\" Christopher COLUMBUS named the island in 1493, after the church of Santa Maria la Antigua (Old Saint Mary's) in Seville, Spain; <em>barbuda </em>is Spanish for \"bearded\" and may refer to the island's lichen-covered fig trees"
